WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
[Waystead’s ABAXI fanfare] ABAXI presents.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.583
A small seaside house becomes a palace. Inside, furnishings and canopy beds appear.

00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:09.250
Mira’s house gains ornate furniture, a new rug, and a glowing orrery.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:12.250
Clack enters the Staff Shop with a Kelp Lantern and leaves with a Sunclaw Scepter.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:14.750
Clack mines a copper seam.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.833
Clack jumps and brings a charged sword down in a pounce.

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:19.833
A bow shot cuts through the mine.

00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:21.833
Clack jumps above a group of monsters and casts Tidehex.

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.333
Clack fights in the neighborhood ring.

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:28.000
[Music swells] The ring becomes the Imperial Dome. Clack wins and the crowd throws gold.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Clack. The deep bites back. Powered by Decapod Labs.
